  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759234,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 101 Dalmata: A SNES Pirate Hack Adventure\n\nStep into a charmingly chaotic world with *101 Dalmata*, a unique and unauthorized SNES hack of *Beethoven: The Ultimate Canine Caper*. Released in February 1998, this fan-made creation reimagines the original game with a delightful Dalmatian twist.\n\nEmbark on a quest filled with playful mischief and heartwarming moments as you guide a pack of adorable Dalmatians through a vibrant, altered landscape. While retaining the core gameplay mechanics of the original *Beethoven* title, *101 Dalmata* introduces new challenges and a fresh perspective on the canine caper. Expect platforming action, puzzle-solving, and plenty of opportunities to showcase your love for these spotted companions.\n\nThis pirate hack is a testament to the creativity of the Twin Eagles Group, offering a nostalgic and quirky experience for SNES enthusiasts and Dalmatian lovers alike. Prepare for a lighthearted adventure brimming with canine charm and unexpected surprises!"
    },
